    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[16.2.0 — 14 October 2021]]></title>
        <id>title-34e19c582d359dbcf8a4335946c288cd</id>
        <link href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VMware_Workstation?link_extraction_failed=true"/>
        <updated>2026-07-10T21:05:33.879Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<ul id="mwBOM"><li id="mwBOQ">Added support for <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vulkan" title="Vulkan" id="mwBOU">Vulkan</a> renderer on a Linux host with Intel, Nvidia, and AMD GPUs</li>
<li id="mwBOY">Added partial support for <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Windows_11" title="Windows 11" id="mwBOc">Windows 11</a> as host or guest machines<sup about="#mwt501" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-win11_95-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;win11&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-win11-95&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-win11-95" id="mwBOg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBOk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBOo">[</span>95<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBOs">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwBOw">Host GPUs that do not support <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DirectX" title="DirectX" id="mwBO0">DirectX</a> feature level 11.1 are supported but deprecated<sup about="#mwt504" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-96" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-96&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-96" id="mwBO4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBO8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBPA">[</span>96<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBPE">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwBPI">Host CPUs that do not support <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mode-based_Execution_Control" title="Mode-based Execution Control" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBPM">Mode-based Execution Control</a> are supported but deprecated</li>
<li id="mwBPQ">Security updates and bug fixes</li></ul>]]></content>
