    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[17.5 — 19 October 2023]]></title>
        <id>title-5595ae236b1243918c39c327476426f6</id>
        <link href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VMware_Workstation?link_extraction_failed=true"/>
        <updated>2026-07-10T21:05:33.879Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<ul id="mwBWI"><li id="mwBWM">Support for up to 256 NVMe devices (4 controllers and 64 devices per controller)</li>
<li id="mwBWQ">Support for NVMe 1.3</li>
<li id="mwBWU">Upgraded encryption algorithm from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption_theory#Cipher-block_chaining_(CBC)" title="Disk encryption theory" id="mwBWY">CBC</a> to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption_theory#XEX-based_tweaked-codebook_mode_with_ciphertext_stealing_(XTS)" title="Disk encryption theory" id="mwBWc">XTS</a></li>
<li id="mwBWg">New <code class="mw-highlight mw-highlight-lang-text mw-content-ltr" style="" dir="ltr" typeof="mw:Extension/syntaxhighlight mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt550" id="mwBWk" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;syntaxhighlight&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;lang&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;inline&quot;:&quot;1&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;VMRUN&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;code&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Code&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;VMRUN&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}">VMRUN</code> command line utility for controlling virtual machines</li>
<li id="mwBWo">Support for importing or exporting virtual machines with vTPM device</li>
<li id="mwBWs">Support for managing power operations of encrypted virtual machines using VMREST API</li>
<li id="mwBWw">Security updates and bug fixes</li></ul>]]></content>
