        <id>title-7d4f2bcbec84fa75779773799ecc6fe6</id>
        <link href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VMware_Workstation?link_extraction_failed=true"/>
        <updated>2026-07-10T21:05:33.879Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<ul id="mwBX8"><li id="mwBYA">Copyrights of program now link to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Broadcom" title="Broadcom" id="mwBYE">Broadcom</a>, VMware LLC's new owner</li>
