<li id="mwBYM">Workstation Player was discontinued as Workstation Pro became free for personal use<sup about="#mwt562" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:0_15-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;:0&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-:0-15" id="mwBYQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBYU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBYY">[</span>15<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBYc">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwBYg">Fixed CVE-2024-22267, CVE-2024-22268, CVE-2024-22269, and CVE-2024-22270 vulnerabilities</li>
<li id="mwBYk">Last version for <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Windows_Server_2012_R2" title="Windows Server 2012 R2" id="mwBYo">Windows Server 2012 R2</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Windows_Server_2016" title="Windows Server 2016" id="mwBYs">Windows Server 2016</a> on hosts</li></ul>]]></content>
